# Workers Static Assets routing.
#
# SPA fallback (any unmatched URL → index.html) is handled by
# wrangler.jsonc → assets.not_found_handling = "single-page-application".
# Don't add a catch-all (/*) here — Cloudflare's linter flags it as an
# infinite loop and the deploy fails (error code 100324).
#
# Only declare rewrites that the SPA mode can't handle on its own.

# Admin SPA shell
/admin           /admin.html                       200
/admin/*         /admin.html                       200

# Favicon legacy path → SVG
/favicon.ico     /assets/images/favicon.svg        200
